{"ref":"BDB, מְשׂוּרָה","hw":"מְשׂוּרָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מְשׂוּרָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. measure</strong>, of water, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 4:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.4.11\">Ez 4:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 4:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.4.16\">16</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁקָל</span>); capacity in gen., <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:35\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.35\">Lv 19:35</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדָּה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁקָל</span>), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:29\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.29\">1 Ch 23:29</a> <strong>(</strong>deriv. dub.<strong>)</strong>","next":"BDB, מָשׂוֹשׂ","prev":"BDB, מַשּׂוֹר"}